 11	//      step_finished on the SSE stream, wrapped in a TOOL span) and its result goes back as the
 12	//      `tool` message for that call id; an invalid or repeated call gets an explanatory `tool` result
 13	//      and no step. Text the model writes next to its tool calls becomes a `note` event (≤ 20 words).
